  "n_train": 140,
  "model_algorithm": "ordinary least squares line of yield on one contrast reading; scale, band means and contrast folded into 15 coefficients on the SG35 second derivative; x_center = 0; offset = intercept",
  "selection": "panel study of readers that fail in different ways; the C–H side of the panel, checked on held-out collections",
